                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The reenactment of the embryonic development in evolution of the species."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b13e5a6-1961-314e-9839-925cd1a1f0ef",
                                        "entry_id": "907e4340-cf76-36b2-a753-52201835e7c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The symmetry provided by Christ's life to the teachings of the Old Testament; the summation of human experience in Jesus Christ."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6dd9830b-0951-4d76-bb97-3dffe6a2bb87",
                                                "sense_id": "7b13e5a6-1961-314e-9839-925cd1a1f0ef",
                                                "text": "one would expect God's final purpose to be expressed in his created world, since the doctrine of recapitulation showed that this is where his plans had worked out before."
